{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type MutationScope = object;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/types.ts#L1826","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/query-core/src/types.ts:1826"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Groups mutations so they run one after another instead of in parallel.\nMutations that share the same "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"id"},{"type":"text","value":" form a queue: while one is running, the others wait in "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"isPaused: true"},{"type":"text","value":"\nstate and resume automatically when their turn comes. Mutations with no scope always run in parallel."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"properties","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Properties"}]},{"type":"table","align":[null,null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Property"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Description"}]}],"rows":[[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineHtml","value":"<a id=\"property-id\">"},{"type":"inlineHtml","value":"</a>"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"id"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The scope's identifier. Mutations with the same "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"id"},{"type":"text","value":" run one after another."}]}]]}],"headings":[{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype MutationScope = object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/types.ts:1826](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/types.ts#L1826)\n\nGroups mutations so they run one after another instead of in parallel.\nMutations that share the same `id` form a queue: while one is running, the others wait in `isPaused: true`\nstate and resume automatically when their turn comes. Mutations with no scope always run in parallel.\n\n## Properties\n\n| Property | Type | Description |\n| ------ | ------ | ------ |\n| <a id=\"property-id\"></a> `id` | `string` | The scope's identifier. Mutations with the same `id` run one after another. |\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: MutationScope\ntitle: MutationScope\n---\n\n```ts\ntype MutationScope = object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/types.ts:1826](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/types.ts#L1826)\n\nGroups mutations so they run one after another instead of in parallel.\nMutations that share the same `id` form a queue: while one is running, the others wait in `isPaused: true`\nstate and resume automatically when their turn comes. Mutations with no scope always run in parallel.\n\n## Properties\n\n| Property | Type | Description |\n| ------ | ------ | ------ |\n| <a id=\"property-id\"></a> `id` | `string` | The scope's identifier. Mutations with the same `id` run one after another. |\n"}
